title: "IVEA: Integrative variational Bayesian inference of regulatory element activity for predicting enhancer–gene regulatory interactions"
abstract: "IVEA predicts enhancer–gene regulatory interactions by estimating promoter and enhancer activities via variational Bayesian inference, using cell-type-specific chromatin accessibility (DNase-seq/ATAC-seq), chromatin contact (Hi-C), and gene expression (RNA-seq) data."
